    below is missing from lib/ at runtime.

    After adding/updating dependencies, run:
        ant updateMavenDependencies -Dextname=payonepcpcore

    This resolves the POM and downloads jars into the extension's lib/ folder.

    ===================================================================
    The transitive block below is GENERATED, not remembered. Bumping the
    SDK version means regenerating it:

        scripts/check-external-dependencies.sh payonepcpcore write

    which resolves the real tree with `mvn dependency:tree` and rewrites the
    block. Called without the write argument it only diffs and exits non-zero;
    that is what the verify-dependencies CI job runs, so an SDK bump that
    silently truncates the classpath fails the build instead of shipping.
    (XML comments cannot contain a double hyphen, hence no leading dashes on
    that argument here — the script accepts either spelling.)

    Generated for : io.github.payone-gmbh:pcp-serversdk-java 1.13.0
    Generated on  : 2026-08-07
    Resolver      : Apache Maven 3.9.16

    NOTE: the SDK POM carries a `published-with-gradle-metadata` marker. The POM
